# Lab06 transfer model with negative (~) values = [ERROR] values (ASCII only!)
From: Valid, ~Frozen, ~Missing
To: Valid, ~Missing, ~SameAsFrom
Amount: Normal, ExactBalance, ~Zero, ~Negative, ~OverBalance, ~OverLimit, ~OverOnlyAfterConversion
Currency: Same, Different

# still needed: impossible property combination
IF [Amount] = "OverOnlyAfterConversion" THEN [Currency] = "Different";
